      "source": "<a href=\"DefaultedPageable.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DefaultedPageable</code></a> implementation of <a href=\"ExcerptProjector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>ExcerptProjector</code></a> that uses the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/projection/ProjectionFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.projection\"><code>ProjectionFactory</code></a>\nand considers the given <a href=\"../../core/mapping/ResourceMappings.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceMappings</code></a>.",
